Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 18:42:59 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] imx8m: phyboard_polis: Add SELinux policies, seccomp
 filters, and VINTF manifests

Add board-specific sepolicy (file_contexts, genfs_contexts), seccomp policy files, app whitelist, and VINTF device manifests.
---
 imx8m/phyboard_polis/app_whitelist.xml        | 36 +++++++++++++
